sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Q as BullMQ
  participant W as Worker
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant P as External Provider
  participant S as Socket.IO

  rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over Q,S: Common auto-completion and replay behavior
    Q->>W: Deliver job and acquire lock
    W->>DB: Read durable business state
    alt State already terminal
      DB-->>W: Completed state exists
      W-->>Q: return skipped
      Q->>Q: Move job to completed
    else Permanent invalid state
      DB-->>W: Cannot recover with same input
      W-->>Q: throw UnrecoverableError
      Q->>Q: Move job to failed without retry
    else Retryable work
      W->>DB: Claim/checkpoint unique business identity
      W->>P: Perform external side effect with stable identity
      P-->>W: Result
      W->>DB: Persist durable success/checkpoint
      DB-->>W: Commit
      W->>S: Emit best-effort domain event
      W-->>Q: return succeeded
      Q->>Q: Move job to completed
    end
  end

  rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over Q,S: Retry after transient failure
    Q->>W: Deliver attempt
    W->>DB: Read or claim same domain identity
    W->>P: Call provider
    P--xW: Transient failure
    W--xQ: throw Error
    alt Attempts remain
      Q->>Q: Backoff then return to waiting
      Q->>W: Redeliver same job
    else Final attempt exhausted
      Q->>Q: Move job to failed
      W->>DB: Persist one terminal failure state
      W->>S: Emit one terminal failure event
    end
  end

  rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over Q,S: Report crash after provider success
    Q->>W: Deliver report settingId + dueDate
    W->>DB: Upsert deliveryKey
    W->>P: Send email with same idempotency key
    P-->>W: Accepted
    W--xQ: Process crashes before BullMQ completion
    Q->>Q: Lock expires / job becomes stalled
    Q->>W: Redeliver job
    W->>DB: Read same deliveryKey
    W->>P: Retry with same idempotency key if DB not terminal
    P-->>W: Return original provider result
    W->>DB: Persist SENT
    W-->>Q: return succeeded
  end

  rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over Q,S: Bulk import resume
    Q->>W: Deliver importBatchId
    W->>DB: Load processedCount checkpoint
    loop Remaining chunks
      W->>DB: Insert rows with importBatchId + rowIndex
      DB-->>W: Insert or duplicate no-op
      W->>DB: Persist processedCount and rejectedCount
    end
    W->>DB: Set COMPLETED and terminalAt
    W->>S: Emit bulk-import completed
    W-->>Q: return succeeded
  end

  rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over Q,S: Recurring occurrence
    Q->>W: Deliver source IDs
    W->>DB: Start transaction and re-read source
    W->>DB: Insert child unique by source + occurrence
    W->>DB: Conditionally advance nextRecurringDate
    DB-->>W: Commit
    W-->>Q: return succeeded or verified skipped
  end

